sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant AWX as "AWX/AAP Job"
    participant AE as "Ansible Executor"
    participant VSP as "VaultSSH Connection Plugin"
    participant Vault as "Vault (hvac Client)"
    participant K8sVol as "K8s Projected Volume"
    participant VJ as "Vault JWT Auth Backend"
    participant SSH as "Parent SSH Plugin"
    participant RH as "Remote Host"

    AWX->>AE: Launch job and run task for target host
    AE->>VSP: Instantiate vault_ssh connection plugin
    Note over VSP: vault_ssh extends the built-in ssh connection plugin

    AE->>VSP: Request connection (_connect())
    VSP->>VSP: Build hvac.Client(url, namespace, TLS options)
    VSP->>Vault: Authenticate using configured method
    alt token authentication
        VSP->>Vault: Set client.token from vault_token or token file
        Vault-->>VSP: Token accepted: authenticated client
    else AppRole authentication
        VSP->>Vault: auth.approle.login(role_id, secret_id, mount_point)
        Vault-->>VSP: Authenticated client token and lease duration
    else JWT authentication
        VSP->>K8sVol: Read JWT token file at ansible_vault_jwt_path
        K8sVol-->>VSP: Projected service account JWT
        VSP->>VSP: Parse JWT claims: check exp (not expired), nbf (not before), and aud matches ansible_vault_jwt_audience
        alt Local JWT validation fails
            VSP-->>AE: Raise AnsibleConnectionFailure: stop connection flow
        else Local JWT validation succeeds
            VSP->>VJ: hvac client.auth.jwt.jwt_login(role, jwt, mount_point)
            Note over VJ: Verify JWT signature via K8s API / OIDC discovery: check bound_audiences and bound_service_account_names/namespaces
            VJ->>VJ: Call Kubernetes TokenReview API to validate service-account identity
            VJ-->>VJ: TokenReview response / token identity
            VJ-->>Vault: Client token with policies
            Vault-->>VSP: Authenticated client token and lease duration
        end
    end

    VSP->>VSP: Render vault_secret_path for target host
    VSP->>Vault: Read KV v1/v2 secret at mount/path
    Vault-->>VSP: Credential secret data

    VSP->>VSP: Resolve username, password, private_key, become_password
    opt private_key is present
        VSP->>VSP: Write PEM private key to 0600 temporary file
        VSP->>VSP: Set private_key_file to temporary file path
    end
    VSP->>VSP: Inject options: ansible_user (remote_user), password, private_key_file, become_password
    VSP->>SSH: Call super()._connect() / delegate to parent ssh plugin
    SSH->>RH: Establish SSH connection using resolved options
    RH-->>SSH: SSH session established
    SSH-->>VSP: Connected transport
    VSP-->>AE: Return connected channel
    AE-->>AWX: Execute task over SSH and report result

    alt reset connection
        AE->>VSP: reset()
        VSP->>SSH: Delegate reset / close control socket
        SSH-->>VSP: Reset complete
        VSP->>VSP: Clean up temporary private-key file
        VSP-->>AE: Reset complete: allow credential re-resolution
    else close connection
        AE->>VSP: close()
        VSP->>SSH: Delegate close
        SSH-->>VSP: Close complete
        VSP->>VSP: Clean up temporary private-key file
        VSP-->>AE: Closed
    end
